{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":153,"count":24,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L05-3-05\",\"窗户\",\"窗戶\",\"窗户\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"窗戶前面有很多花，很漂亮。","pinyin":"Chuānghù qiánmiàn yǒu hěn duō huā, hěn piàoliàng.","english":"There are many flowers in front of the window. It’s very beautiful.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-3-05","sourceFront":"窗戶","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L07-1-25\",\"出发\",\"出發\",\"出发\",\"Vp\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這班車早上七點從台北出發，只停了三個站就到花蓮了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-25","sourceFront":"出發","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我旅行的方式很隨意，出發前從不先規劃行程。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-34","sourceFront":"隨意","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L11-1-21\",\"复习\",\"複習\",\"复习\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"教授說，期末考的筆試比較難，一定要好好地複習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-1-21","sourceFront":"複習","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"快考試了，這本書的前幾課我已經複習完了，可是沒時間念後三課。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-2-04","sourceFront":"前","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"快考試了，這本書的前幾課我已經複習完了，可是沒時間念後三課。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-2-05","sourceFront":"後","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"林同學上課很專心，也很認真地把老師教的寫下來，這樣回家就能複習了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-19","sourceFront":"專心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我同學記筆記的速度很快，也記得很清楚，所以我常跟他借筆記來複習功課。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-17","sourceFront":"記","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在學習中文的期間，小林下課後除了複習功課，也和同學參加了不少社團活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-02","sourceFront":"期間","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"剛學的詞和語法最好常使用、多複習，如此才能加深記憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-16","sourceFront":"加深","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不斷複習生字卡片能幫我們記住新的字。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-35","sourceFront":"記住","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L14-1-10\",\"奶奶\",\"奶奶\",\"奶奶\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"沒想到我奶奶那個年代流行的衣服，現在又流行起來了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-03","sourceFront":"年代","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在我爺爺奶奶的年代，生活比較辛苦，不少窮人為了省錢，衣服破了還是繼續穿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-24","sourceFront":"破","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我奶奶不會用電腦，每次想跟朋友連絡，不是去郵局寄信就是打家裡的電話。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-26","sourceFront":"連絡","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"天氣變涼了，奶奶頭痛的毛病又犯了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-11","sourceFront":"犯","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"奶奶把變黃的蔬菜葉子埋在地裡，讓它變成草地的營養。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-40","sourceFront":"埋","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"奶奶養了幾隻雞，每天早上習慣抓兩把玉米餵牠們。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-27","sourceFront":"把","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這只箱子是以前奶奶留給我的，對我來說是很珍貴的禮物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-36","sourceFront":"只","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"奶奶在後院不只種了綠豆及黃豆，還種了許多蔬菜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-15","sourceFront":"黃豆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我奶奶八十歲了，走起路來腳步仍像年輕人一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-39","sourceFront":"腳步","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L16-1-31\",\"世界文化日\",\"世界文化日\",\"世界文化日\",\"Name\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"世界文化日那天，你想表演什麼？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-05","sourceFront":"表演","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"華語文中心的學生邀請台灣朋友來參加世界文化日的活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-01","sourceFront":"邀請","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L16-2-09\",\"許多\",\"許多\",\"许多\",\"Det\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"許多大學生參加愛心服務的社團，幫助老人打掃環境。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-09","sourceFront":"許多","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這次強烈地震造成了嚴重的災情，不但許多房屋塌了，連橋也斷了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-10","sourceFront":"災情","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為水災的關係，許多學校沒辦法正常上課，甚至連便利商店都關了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-15","sourceFront":"甚至","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那場強烈地震發生以後，許多國家的專業人員都來救災，讓人非常感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-22","sourceFront":"救災","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一聽說颱風快來了，許多民眾就去超市搶購蔬菜、水果、泡麵等食物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-29","sourceFront":"民眾","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大地震過後才幾天，這個災區的民眾除了收到許多衣服和食物，還收到五千萬元，讓大家又驚訝又感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-15","sourceFront":"驚訝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"夏天一到，這個海灘上就會看到許多人帶著衝浪板來衝浪。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-28","sourceFront":"衝浪板","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"許多青少年為了考上好學校，不得不犧牲假日去補習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-03","sourceFront":"犧牲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣護照比以前好用得多，去許多國家旅行都不需要簽證了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-33","sourceFront":"簽證","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"打仗期間，許多軍人為國家犧牲了寶貴的生命，也給家人留下了痛苦的記憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-14","sourceFront":"打仗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"前幾天因為颱風的關係，造成部分地區嚴重淹水，許多蔬果的價格都變高了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-19","sourceFront":"部分","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"畢業當天，許多學生帶著攝影機在校園裡攝影，留下了珍貴的回憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-13","sourceFront":"攝影","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這本小說介紹了許多中國的古人古事，內容既豐富又有趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-32","sourceFront":"古人古事","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那名記者為了訪問總統外交、貿易等方面的問題，閱讀了許多相關的資料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-10","sourceFront":"訪問","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從六○年代開始，臺灣就提供農業方面的協助給許多國家，這點讓我覺得很驕傲。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-11","sourceFront":"農業","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"許多國家因為工業進步得太快，反而使得農業慢慢不被重視了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-22","sourceFront":"工業","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他每次出國，都會幫朋友代購許多具有當地特色的商品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-14","sourceFront":"代購","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個山區種了許多茶樹，到了收穫季節，就會有一群採茶姑娘上山採茶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-12","sourceFront":"採","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人類活動產生許多垃圾，不但汙染了環境，更改變了全球氣候。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-45","sourceFront":"汙染","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我愛看漫畫，在漫畫裡可以看見許多人們還沒實現的夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-05","sourceFront":"漫畫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"花蓮太魯閣的確很漂亮，難怪每年都吸引許多觀光客去參觀。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-15","sourceFront":"的確","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我想了許多辦法去達成公司的目標，卻還是得不到主管的支持。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-32","sourceFront":"目標","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家醫院的內科有最新設備，因此成為許多病人的第一選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-18","sourceFront":"內科","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"台灣這場地震的規模很大，使許多人受輕傷、重傷。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-25","sourceFront":"重傷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了人民的健康，許多國家都禁止進口受到環境汙染的農產品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-12","sourceFront":"禁止","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:那所大學雖然相當著名，但我國政府不承認他們的學位(academic degree)。B:許多國家都承認那所大學的學位，貴國哪裡有不承認的道理？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-57","sourceFront":"哪裡有……的道理？","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有能力的人就算不幸失業了，將來還是有許多機會等待著他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-06","sourceFront":"失業","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人們為了節省勞力，發明了許多實用的機械。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-37","sourceFront":"勞力","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"奶奶在後院不只種了綠豆及黃豆，還種了許多蔬菜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-15","sourceFront":"黃豆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"許多世紀以來，受壓迫的民族都渴望擁有平等的待遇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-40","sourceFront":"壓迫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"傳說月亮上住著一隻兔子，這個神話留給孩子們許多想像空間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-04","sourceFront":"傳說","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"傳統私立高中有許多規定，在管理學生方面相當嚴格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-10","sourceFront":"私立","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"戰爭雖然勝利了，這個國家卻也失去了許多寶貴的生命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-23","sourceFront":"勝利","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這項新發明解決了許多環保問題，發明的人還受國家表揚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-07","sourceFront":"表揚","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L01-1-18\",\"做夢\",\"做夢/作夢\",\"做梦/作梦\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"有人說，有夢最美。應該趁著年輕勇敢地做夢，更要努力讓夢想變成真的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-18","sourceFront":"做夢","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"小鐘昨天晚上做了好幾個夢，沒睡好，難怪今天精神很不好","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-18","sourceFront":"做夢","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:如果現在有一千萬從天上掉下來，那該多好啊！ B:你別再做夢了，趕快回到現實吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-19","sourceFront":"現實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當我聽到被公司錄取的消息時，還以為是做夢，忍不住用力捏了自己一下。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-26","sourceFront":"捏","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我昨天晚上做了一個夢，夢到跟我最喜歡的明星一同演戲，開心得不得了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-07","sourceFront":"一同","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"弟弟做了一個可怕的夢，夜裡三點就醒了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-03","sourceFront":"醒","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人人都喜歡薪水高、離家近、輕鬆的工作，不過這往往只是一個夢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-29","sourceFront":"薪水","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:你說自己沒有想做的事，難道你沒有夢想嗎？ B:我只想簡單過生活，再說，沒有夢想難道不行嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-48","sourceFront":"難道","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"To 做(work) a 夢(dream): 做夢 means dream."},{"key":"[\"B3L08-2-03\",\"合作\",\"合作\",\"合作\",\"Vi/Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我們公司打算今年跟美國合作，生產名牌皮包","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-03","sourceFront":"合作","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"除夕那天，大家都忙著打掃、貼春聯，只有弟弟很不合作，什麼事都不做。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-03","sourceFront":"合作","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這兩家公司在科技方面合作了很多年，也在科學雜誌上發表了共同的研究成果。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-20","sourceFront":"共同","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們工廠與那家旅行社有合作關係，廠內員工如果報名他們的旅行團，都可以享受優惠價。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-14","sourceFront":"旅行社","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"團體活動中，不團結就失去了合作的意義。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-23","sourceFront":"團結","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 合(combine) and 作(make): 合作 means cooperate."},{"key":"[\"B3L09-1-32\",\"培养\",\"培養\",\"培养\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"華語中心除了有培養學生中文能力的課程，還安排了文化課，讓課程更豐富。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-32","sourceFront":"培養","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"父母不能保護孩子一輩子，得讓他們自己經驗一些挫折，才能培養出堅強的性格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-04","sourceFront":"堅強","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大學教育的目的，不僅要提高學生的知識水準，還要進一步培養學生的專業能力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-14","sourceFront":"進一步","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想要讓身體健康，得先注意飲食，少吃太油、太鹹的食物；其次要培養每天運動的好習慣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-19","sourceFront":"其次","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們應該培養獨立思考的能力，別被身邊各種訊息左右。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-23","sourceFront":"左右","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他去當環保志工是為了保護自然環境，也是為了培養耐心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-01","sourceFront":"志工","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L12-1-31\",\"有关\",\"有關\",\"有关\",\"Prep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"有關這場火災的詳細情況，等調查結果出來以後，市長會向民眾報告。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-31","sourceFront":"有關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這堂課的內容跟文化有關，所以老師把教學重心放在介紹各國的文化特色。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-12","sourceFront":"重心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"好幾個人都看到他跟這場火災有關，他不但不承認，反而說是鄰居做的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-06","sourceFront":"反而","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"有人說，男人的話題常跟政治有關，女人的話題不是名牌包、就是化妝品。你同意嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-14","sourceFront":"話題","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A:聽說明天的會跟新商品的推銷計畫有關，你要參加嗎？ B:我是公司的安全人員，這個會應該跟我無關。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-10","sourceFront":"無關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"能不能騎自行車完成環島的行程，跟耐心有關，跟聰明不聰明無關。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-09","sourceFront":"有關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"今天藝術系的學生要在學校的禮堂，演出跟十二生肖有關的故事。 那名演員很厲害，在那部電影裡一個人演出三個角色。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-20","sourceFront":"演出","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"陸教授在自己的網站上發表有關教學和研究的成果，相當值得參考。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-16","sourceFront":"發表","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次會議的主題跟銷售新產